## Item 1: does it read as a white duck?

Result: yes. It reads as a white duck, friendly, rated G, at 128 px and in the 4 views.

- The bill is flat, broad, orange, and closed. There is no comb and no wattle. The GLB has 8 meshes: legs, body,
  tail-fan, coverts, flight, bill, eye-glint, webs.
- The feet are orange and webbed (3 toes). They read as orange blobs at 128 px.
- The eyes are black with a white catch-light. They read at 128 px as a white dot inside a dark dot (S, SW).
- The back sprite N reads as a white blob with 2 wings and no clear tail (F3).
- The wings stand out from the body and read as small arms or fins (F1). This is the largest difference from the brief.

